--- /dev/null
+++ b/backends/platform/esp32/components/tab5_tremor/TAB5-PROVENANCE.md
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# Tremor source pin
+
+Upstream: https://gitlab.xiph.org/xiph/tremor
+Commit: `820fb3237ea81af44c9cc468c8b4e20128e3e5ad`.
+Upstream source is in tremor/, including COPYING. The ESP-IDF wrapper adds
+a CMake component. Local portability patch: the two `point` locals in
+sharedbook.c use `ogg_int32_t`, matching VFLOAT_MULTI/VFLOAT_ADD pointer
+parameters. georgik__ogg defines that type as 32-bit long on P4; upstream
+used int. Both have the same width here; the patch removes incompatible
+pointer access instead of suppressing the compiler error. Portable integer C, no architecture assembly.
+Uses the existing pinned georgik__ogg component. Enables the shared Vorbis path
+for all three SLUDGE games; no transcoding or modified game archives.
diff --git a/backends/platform/esp32/components/tab5_tremor/tremor/.gitlab-ci.yml b/backends/platform/esp32/components/tab5_tremor/tremor/.gitlab-ci.yml
